  36 actions, 26 with other paths

  All  Sessions  The input box  The conversation  Steering  Requests, models and help
  Type to search shortcuts› █
  › Sessions                   Send a prompt, or a steering message during a turn                        Enter
    Sessions                   Insert a line break                                                       Shift+Enter · Ctrl+J
    Sessions                   Close what is on top; interrupt the turn when nothing is open             Esc · click the overlay's ✕ or outside it; click "Esc
                                                                                                         to interrupt"
    Sessions                   Clear the draft, then quit (twice within about a second on an empty box)  Ctrl+C · /quit
    Sessions                   Go home                                                                   ⌥0 · /home
    Sessions                   Start a new session                                                       Ctrl+N · /new
    Sessions                   Switch to the session of rail card N                                      ⌥1 to ⌥9 · click the card
    Sessions                   Delete the selected exited session in the session list (on the row)       Delete, or Backspace · click the row's ✕
    The input box              Recall an earlier prompt from the project of the session on screen (in    ↑
                               an empty box)
    The input box              Search those prompts                                                      Ctrl+R
    The input box              Move by word                                                              ⌥← ⌥→, Ctrl+← Ctrl+→
    The input box              Delete a word                                                             ⌥Backspace
    The input box              Start or end of the line (where the terminal passes them)                 ⌘← ⌘→
    The input box              Open the draft, or a pasted token, in $VISUAL or $EDITOR                  Ctrl+G · click the token
    The input box              Paste an image                                                            Ctrl+V
    The conversation           Open or close the ledgers                                                 Ctrl+O · click a group's line
    The conversation           Move focus from the input box into the conversation                       Shift+Tab · click an item
    The conversation           Move focus to the next or previous item                                   ↓ ↑, j k · click an item
    The conversation           Open the focused item                                                     Enter · click it
    The conversation           Copy the focused item                                                     y · select it
    The conversation           Move focus to the panel, the rail, then the conversation                  Tab · click the area
    The conversation           Show or hide the panel                                                    ⌥P · /panel
    The conversation           Show or hide the rail                                                     ⌥R · drag its edge
    The conversation           Search (where forwarded)                                                  Ctrl+F; Cmd+F
    The conversation           Open the search results (with search open)                                Ctrl+F · click the match count
    The conversation           Next or previous match (with search open)                                 Enter or ↓, Shift+Enter or ↑
    The conversation           Jump to the end                                                           End · click "↓ New messages below"
    Steering                   Select a queued steering message                                          ⌥↑ ⌥↓ · its mouse target
    Steering                   Amend it                                                                  Enter · its mouse target
  ↓ Steering                   Drop it                                                                   ⌥X · its mouse target

